#
# Fail-witness for the winner-slot ban (charter Hard Rule 4, ex:saNoWinnerSlotTerm): a fixture
# that MINTS gmeow:preferredRank as an owl:ObjectProperty — exactly the forbidden "single slot to
# win" the slice mints NO term for (Principle 9). Unioned with the preference module by the
# gmeow:saFailWitness teeth check, it makes the ∃-banned-term ASK HOLD, proving the mustNot ban
# actually catches a re-minted winner-slot rather than passing vacuously. The real module must
# never carry this triple.

@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix owl:   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

gmeow:preferredRank a owl:ObjectProperty .
